{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01DqyCHWTaJp2wfsqkG3xBrH","type":"tool_result","content":"1\tid: srd091-chown\n2\ttitle: \"cmd/chown: Change File Owner and Group\"\n3\t\n4\tproblem: |\n5\t  macOS ships a BSD chown that differs from GNU chown in recursive traversal flags,\n6\t  symlink handling, and OWNER:GROUP parsing. The Go implementation must match the\n7\t  Homebrew GNU reference binary (gchown, installed by coreutils) byte-for-byte on all\n8\t  flag combinations, verified by differential testing via pkg/testutils.\n9\t\n10\tgoals:\n11\t  - G1: Change the owner and/or group of files using OWNER, OWNER:GROUP, OWNER:, :GROUP, or numeric UID:GID syntax.\n12\t  - G2: Support recursive ownership changes with -R and symlink traversal control.\n13\t  - G3: Verify functional parity against gchown via differential testing.\n14\t\n15\trequirements:\n16\t  R1:\n17\t    title: Ownership specification\n18\t    items:\n19\t      - R1.1:\n20\t          text: \"Must accept OWNER[:GROUP] syntax: OWNER changes only owner, OWNER:GROUP changes both, OWNER: changes owner and sets group to OWNER's login group, :GROUP changes only group.\"\n21\t      - R1.2:\n22\t          text: OWNER and GROUP may be names or numeric IDs. Must resolve names to IDs via the system user/group database.\n23\t      - R1.3:\n24\t          text: \"--reference=RFILE must set each FILE's owner and group to match RFILE's.\"\n25\t      - R1.4:\n26\t          text: Must exit 1 when any file cannot be accessed or the owner/group is invalid, printing an error to stderr, and continue processing remaining files.\n27\t\n28\t  R2:\n29\t    title: Recursive and symlink handling\n30\t    items:\n31\t      - R2.1:\n32\t          text: \"-R or --recursive must change ownership recursively for directories and their contents.\"\n33\t      - R2.2:\n34\t          text: \"-h or --no-dereference must change the symlink itself rather than the target.\"\n35\t      - R2.3:\n36\t          text: \"-H must follow symlinks on the command line only. -L must follow all symlinks. -P must never follow symlinks (default with -R).\"\n37\t\n38\t  R3:\n39\t    title: Output control and exit codes\n40\t    items:\n41\t      - R3.1:\n42\t          text: \"-v or --verbose must print a diagnostic for every file processed. -c or --changes must print only when changes are made. -f or --silent must suppress most errors.\"\n43\t      - R3.2:\n44\t          text: Must exit 0 when all files are processed successfully. Must exit 1 on any error.\n45\t      - R3.3:\n46\t          text: Must handle SIGPIPE gracefully (exit 0) using pkg/sys.InstallSIGPIPEHandler.\n47\t\n48\tnon_goals:\n49\t  - cmd/chown does not implement --preserve-root.\n50\t  - cmd/chown does not implement --from=CURRENT_OWNER:CURRENT_GROUP conditional change.\n51\t\n52\tacceptance_criteria:\n53\t  - id: AC1\n54\t    criterion: \"chown user:staff file changes owner and group, matching gchown.\"\n55\t    traces:\n56\t      - R1.1\n57\t      - R1.2\n58\t  - id: AC2\n59\t    criterion: \"chown -R user dir recursively changes owner, matching gchown -R.\"\n60\t    traces:\n61\t      - R2.1\n62\t  - id: AC3\n63\t    criterion: \"chown :staff file changes only group, matching gchown.\"\n64\t    traces:\n65\t      - R1.1\n66\t  - id: AC4\n67\t    criterion: \"Differential test against gchown passes for all required test cases.\"\n68\t    traces:\n69\t      - R1.1\n70\t      - R1.2\n71\t      - R2.1\n72\t  - id: AC5\n73\t    criterion: \"cmd/chown compiles with no warnings under golangci-lint.\"\n74\t    traces:\n75\t      - R1.1\n76\t      - R1.2\n77\t      - R1.3\n78\t      - R1.4\n79\t      - R2.1\n80\t      - R2.2\n81\t      - R2.3\n82\t      - R3.1\n83\t      - R3.2\n84\t      - R3.3\n85\t\n86\tpackage_contract:\n87\t  imports:\n88\t    - github.com/petar-djukic/go-unix-utils/pkg/sys\n89\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"28576ec6-2aa4-4dfd-9a4a-73f493f2dc46","uuid":"183dc476-63ad-4950-98ff-a4ebb487633d","timestamp":"2026-05-24T01:30:00.133Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/private/var/folders/dl/cbns6zkx7txc7pt64b6cgzp40000gn/T/go-unix-utils-worktrees/5555/docs/specs/software-requirements/srd091-chown.yaml","content":"id: srd091-chown\ntitle: \"cmd/chown: Change File Owner and Group\"\n\nproblem: |\n  macOS ships a BSD chown that differs from GNU chown in recursive traversal flags,\n  symlink handling, and OWNER:GROUP parsing. The Go implementation must match the\n  Homebrew GNU reference binary (gchown, installed by coreutils) byte-for-byte on all\n  flag combinations, verified by differential testing via pkg/testutils.\n\ngoals:\n  - G1: Change the owner and/or group of files using OWNER, OWNER:GROUP, OWNER:, :GROUP, or numeric UID:GID syntax.\n  - G2: Support recursive ownership changes with -R and symlink traversal control.\n  - G3: Verify functional parity against gchown via differential testing.\n\nrequirements:\n  R1:\n    title: Ownership specification\n    items:\n      - R1.1:\n          text: \"Must accept OWNER[:GROUP] syntax: OWNER changes only owner, OWNER:GROUP changes both, OWNER: changes owner and sets group to OWNER's login group, :GROUP changes only group.\"\n      - R1.2:\n          text: OWNER and GROUP may be names or numeric IDs. Must resolve names to IDs via the system user/group database.\n      - R1.3:\n          text: \"--reference=RFILE must set each FILE's owner and group to match RFILE's.\"\n      - R1.4:\n          text: Must exit 1 when any file cannot be accessed or the owner/group is invalid, printing an error to stderr, and continue processing remaining files.\n\n  R2:\n    title: Recursive and symlink handling\n    items:\n      - R2.1:\n          text: \"-R or --recursive must change ownership recursively for directories and their contents.\"\n      - R2.2:\n          text: \"-h or --no-dereference must change the symlink itself rather than the target.\"\n      - R2.3:\n          text: \"-H must follow symlinks on the command line only. -L must follow all symlinks. -P must never follow symlinks (default with -R).\"\n\n  R3:\n    title: Output control and exit codes\n    items:\n      - R3.1:\n          text: \"-v or --verbose must print a diagnostic for every file processed. -c or --changes must print only when changes are made. -f or --silent must suppress most errors.\"\n      - R3.2:\n          text: Must exit 0 when all files are processed successfully. Must exit 1 on any error.\n      - R3.3:\n          text: Must handle SIGPIPE gracefully (exit 0) using pkg/sys.InstallSIGPIPEHandler.\n\nnon_goals:\n  - cmd/chown does not implement --preserve-root.\n  - cmd/chown does not implement --from=CURRENT_OWNER:CURRENT_GROUP conditional change.\n\nacceptance_criteria:\n  - id: AC1\n    criterion: \"chown user:staff file changes owner and group, matching gchown.\"\n    traces:\n      - R1.1\n      - R1.2\n  - id: AC2\n    criterion: \"chown -R user dir recursively changes owner, matching gchown -R.\"\n    traces:\n      - R2.1\n  - id: AC3\n    criterion: \"chown :staff file changes only group, matching gchown.\"\n    traces:\n      - R1.1\n  - id: AC4\n    criterion: \"Differential test against gchown passes for all required test cases.\"\n    traces:\n      - R1.1\n      - R1.2\n      - R2.1\n  - id: AC5\n    criterion: \"cmd/chown compiles with no warnings under golangci-lint.\"\n    traces:\n      - R1.1\n      - R1.2\n      - R1.3\n      - R1.4\n      - R2.1\n      - R2.2\n      - R2.3\n      - R3.1\n      - R3.2\n      - R3.3\n\npackage_contract:\n  imports:\n    - github.com/petar-djukic/go-unix-utils/pkg/sys\n","numLines":89,"startLine":1,"totalLines":89}}}
